  "prompt": "You are the single chef of a simulated pasta kitchen. Serve the accepted order using the supplied tools. Choose actions from the current observation. Call a tool each decision; do not merely describe your plan. Start available background heating before chef preparation to overlap work. Tasks reserve their listed resources until completion; dependencies require completed tasks of the same order. Start does not advance time. Use advance_to_next_event to wait when appropriate. Serve with serve_order only after completion_tasks finish. Respond to rejected actions using the fresh observation. Never claim service without a successful serve_order result. Recipe: {\"id\": \"lemon_pasta\", \"name\": \"Lemon Pasta\", \"ingredients\": [\"spaghetti\", \"water\", \"salt\", \"lemon\", \"butter\", \"garlic\", \"mint\", \"cheese\"], \"tasks\": [{\"id\": \"collect_ingredients\", \"description\": \"Collect the recipe ingredients.\", \"duration\": 20, \"requires\": [], \"resources\": [\"chef\"]}, {\"id\": \"boil_water\", \"description\": \"Heat salted water in the pot.\", \"duration\": 120, \"requires\": [\"collect_ingredients\"], \"resources\": [\"pot\", \"burner\"]}, {\"id\": \"prepare_mint\", \"description\": \"Prepare the mint.\", \"duration\": 20, \"requires\": [\"collect_ingredients\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\"]}, {\"id\": \"crush_garlic\", \"description\": \"Crush the garlic.\", \"duration\": 20, \"requires\": [\"collect_ingredients\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\"]}, {\"id\": \"cook_pasta_halfway\", \"description\": \"Add pasta and cook for half its total cooking time.\", \"duration\": 240, \"requires\": [\"boil_water\"], \"resources\": [\"pot\", \"burner\"]}, {\"id\": \"reserve_water_and_drain\", \"description\": \"Reserve pasta water, drain pasta, and remove the pot from the burner.\", \"duration\": 20, \"requires\": [\"cook_pasta_halfway\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\", \"pot\"]}, {\"id\": \"prepare_sauce\", \"description\": \"Heat butter and garlic in the pan, then add reserved pasta water.\", \"duration\": 40, \"requires\": [\"reserve_water_and_drain\", \"crush_garlic\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\", \"pan\", \"burner\"]}, {\"id\": \"finish_pasta\", \"description\": \"Add pasta to the pan and finish cooking, stirring and adding pasta water.\", \"duration\": 240, \"requires\": [\"prepare_sauce\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\", \"pan\", \"burner\"]}, {\"id\": \"finish_off_heat\", \"description\": \"Off heat, mix in zest, butter, cheese, mint, and lemon juice.\", \"duration\": 30, \"requires\": [\"finish_pasta\", \"prepare_mint\"], \"resources\": [\"chef\", \"pan\"]}], \"completion_tasks\": [\"finish_off_heat\"]}\n\nPrioritize meeting the deadline of every order. Before assigning shared resources, consider each order's deadline and remaining tasks. If not all deadlines can be met, minimize the number of late orders first, then the total lateness.",
